"FPort would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to "
"\"15\"."
msgstr "FPort 需将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「15」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-V3.rst:361
#: 073446b8d19f416f898531ad9d418fa8 0b6da7eb457c4d648605eacc82046d8e
