"SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\" "
"and connects only the UART4 TX pin."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」，且仅连接 UART4 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-V3.rst:365
